<name>Brake</name>
<section id="1002J_S000U" variety="S000U">
<name>Brake Control</name>
<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060E00VX" category="C" type-id="300F1" name-id="442OJ-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1210/36</dtccode>
<dtcname>Yaw Rate Sensor 0 Point Not Calibrated</dtcname>
<dtccode>C1336/39</dtccode>
<dtcname>G Sensor 0 Point Not Calibrated</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060E00VX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004GK00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>If the skid control computer is replaced, the yaw rate &amp; G sensor 0 point acquisition procedure is necessary.</ptxt>
<ptxt>If the yaw rate sensor is replaced, it is necessary to clear the yaw rate &amp; G sensor 0 point stored values in the skid control sensor and then perform the acquisition procedure again.</ptxt>
<ptxt>This code is output if the yaw rate &amp; G sensor 0 point acquisition is incomplete.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.50in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.81in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1210/36</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Yaw rate sensor 0 point not calibrated</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(Perform the 0 point acquisition and clear the codes; if the code is not output again, there is no malfunction)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1336/39</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Deceleration sensor 0 point not calibrated</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(Perform the 0 point acquisition and clear the codes; if the code is not output again, there is no malfunction)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Code Display List</title>
